						#
					</a>
				</h2>
				<p>
					Numbered proposals, each picking one candidate per mark with the reason: open while reviewed, decided once
					signed off. A settled mark is in none.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="pr-rounds">
				{ROUNDS.map((rd) => (
					<article class="pr-round">
						<header class="pr-round__head">
							<b>{rd.label}</b>
							<span class:list={['pr-status', rd.state === 'open' ? 'pr-status--exploring' : 'pr-status--shipped']}>
								{rd.state === 'open' ? 'Open' : 'Decided'}
